hockwave causing damage and knock up  to all enemies enemies closer to Gabe  take full damage enemies at the furthest  edge take less  Gabe's third ability is called stone  shield Gabe targets himself or an ally  to put a shield around the shield blocks  all damage and knock-back effects and  lasts until it's time expires or takes  enough damage to be destroyed the shield  also cleanses any CC when applied Gabe's  ultimate is called Cataclysm Gabe pulls  apart the earth ax dealing magical  damage to all enemy gods based on a  percent of their current health and  stunning them  in this first fight gebben Apollo come  in from the jungle in the sheet and roll  out gebbs knock back fails the spender  takes off with Apollo cleansing his ally  with shield gabe takes the kill with a  deadly shockwave in the second fight get  places stone shield on himself as he  dives the phoenix knocking up a mousse  and calm and sun wukong with shockwave  gab gets an assist from mousse and as he  takes down Wukong in this final fight  Gavin as allies push the middle Phoenix  stunning all nearby enemies with  Cataclysm Gabe continues with a  shockwave at amis and have an ill  executed blink sees the god of these  pummeled  as the god of earth gag controls the  terrain around him to shield his allies  and refuse enemies starting him off with  shockwave is an excellent idea for its  wave clear and knock up potential next  picking up stone shield can aid gebbs  laning partner and counter any crowd  control threats from there the priority  shift to Cataclysm stone shield  shockwave rollout hell anims and cab  make their golden debut also introduced  in this patch is the addition of a brand  new arena map matches will randomly  rotate between the traditional arena map  and the newly updated nighttime arena  the traditional Maps the gameplay rules  will remain the same while in the newly  updated map the manticore will spawn  after every 10 player kills on a side if  your side can escort the manticore  through the other teams portal you gain  extra points  thanks for watching the smite God reveal  for Gabe god of Earth
 

